WEBVTT

00:01.810 --> 00:04.190
<b>Oh, I guess it's nice to meet you!</b>

00:04.610 --> 00:06.780
<b>King Lionheart...</b>

00:06.780 --> 00:10.280
<b>and I don't really get it,
but the girl with amazing Magical Energy!</b>

00:11.240 --> 00:14.620
<b>Why is your umbrella
open inside a building?</b>

00:14.620 --> 00:16.580
<b>I think that's the least of our concerns.</b>

00:16.580 --> 00:18.750
<b>I'm glad you asked!</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:21.290
<b>The answer is simple. It's because...</b>

00:21.540 --> 00:24.040
<b>it's going to rain in here momentarily!</b>

00:28.170 --> 00:29.590
<b>This is...</b>

00:31.220 --> 00:32.890
<b>Another irritating pest!</b>

00:43.060 --> 00:45.060
<b>You worried about that police squad?</b>

00:45.060 --> 00:47.900
<b>You guys were at each other's necks,
too, you know.</b>

00:48.190 --> 00:50.530
<b>I won't let you do as you please!</b>

00:50.530 --> 00:51.490
<b>That's all!</b>

00:51.490 --> 00:53.320
<b>No, that's not quite true!</b>

00:53.700 --> 00:57.990
<b>You learned they were trying
to save Tsubaki Kuruoka...</b>

00:57.990 --> 01:00.460
<b>and that's when you started
respecting them, right?</b>

01:01.080 --> 01:03.370
<b>I know everything about y—</b>

01:04.920 --> 01:09.300
<b>However, Mages are the
epitome of rationalists.</b>

01:09.300 --> 01:13.130
<b>Ultimately, they <i>will</i> choose
the path to kill Tsubaki Kuruoka.</b>

01:13.380 --> 01:17.350
<b>Ah, perhaps the one
that will end that girl's life will be...</b>

01:17.640 --> 01:19.850
<b>that mercenary?</b>

01:21.480 --> 01:25.900
<b>A hero who protects humanity
would choose that path without a doubt!</b>

01:25.900 --> 01:31.990
<b>Because sacrificing one little girl
will give salvation to everyone else!</b>

01:32.860 --> 01:34.740
<b>I'm Francesca.</b>

01:34.740 --> 01:36.410
<b>And this is François.</b>

01:36.780 --> 01:40.050
<b>If I said we're the True Caster faction,</b>

01:40.080 --> 01:44.330
<b>bookies and troublemakers
for this Holy Grail War...</b>

01:44.620 --> 01:46.580
<b>would you get the gist of things?</b>

01:46.580 --> 01:49.630
<b>I don't get it at all,
but thanks for helping us out!</b>

01:51.210 --> 01:53.130
<b>No need for thanks!</b>

01:53.130 --> 01:56.840
<b>Because we came here to sully you.</b>

01:58.180 --> 01:59.600
<b>Hmm?</b>

01:59.600 --> 02:01.890
<b>Changed quite a bit, have you?</b>

02:01.890 --> 02:06.770
<b>Did King Lionheart drag you along
and make you stronger, as well?</b>

02:07.190 --> 02:07.980
<b>Or...</b>

02:08.480 --> 02:13.240
<b>are you a fox that feels big
because you're next to someone strong?</b>

02:13.570 --> 02:14.570
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

02:15.030 --> 02:17.030
<b>Ayaka has been strong from the beginning!</b>

02:17.030 --> 02:21.660
<b>She does have sharp eyes like a fox,
but she isn't one to wheedle other people!</b>

02:22.200 --> 02:24.910
<b>Great! You really are great!</b>

02:24.910 --> 02:29.170
<b>You really are one who
goes with the moment.</b>

02:29.670 --> 02:31.170
<b>Ayaka, was it?</b>

02:31.460 --> 02:33.840
<b>You have come across a great king!</b>

02:34.300 --> 02:37.140
<b>That's why we have to apologize
right now, you see!</b>

02:37.140 --> 02:38.470
<b>Sorry, sorry!</b>

02:38.470 --> 02:41.140
<b>For now, we're gonna be trampling a bit...</b>

02:41.430 --> 02:43.100
<b>upon this king's admiration!</b>

02:45.690 --> 02:46.810
<b>This is...</b>

02:46.810 --> 02:47.810
<b>No way!</b>

02:48.230 --> 02:49.150
<b>How...</b>

02:49.860 --> 02:51.150
<b>This is...</b>

02:51.150 --> 02:53.780
<b>where I was before...
the castle in Fuyuki!</b>

03:00.830 --> 03:02.870
<b>Was that a chariot just now?</b>

03:02.870 --> 03:04.950
<b>Bulls clad in lightning...</b>

03:04.950 --> 03:06.000
<b>It can't be!</b>

03:06.290 --> 03:07.620
<b>H-Huh?</b>

03:08.790 --> 03:09.710
<b>You're kidding me!</b>

03:10.040 --> 03:12.880
<b>I had heard the real deal
was a massive figure, but...</b>

03:12.880 --> 03:13.800
<b>Who is that?</b>

03:14.300 --> 03:16.840
<b>That's Alexander the Great!</b>

03:25.220 --> 03:26.680
<b>Philia?</b>

03:27.190 --> 03:28.390
<b>No.</b>

03:28.390 --> 03:29.900
<b>Something is different.</b>

03:36.400 --> 03:38.610
<b>Is this... a dream?</b>

03:39.070 --> 03:40.160
<b>Huh?</b>

03:40.950 --> 03:42.830
<b>Oh my goodness.</b>

03:43.200 --> 03:45.120
<b>Is that someone you know?</b>

03:46.120 --> 03:48.080
<b>No, this is a first for my eyes.</b>

03:49.120 --> 03:54.090
<b>There are two reasons
why I am standing here, not kneeling.</b>

03:54.090 --> 03:57.840
<b>One is because I am a
king, even if imperfect.</b>

03:57.840 --> 04:00.180
<b>Huh? Wh-What are you talking about?</b>

04:00.800 --> 04:02.180
<b>The other is...</b>

04:02.180 --> 04:03.650
<b>to burn this legend</b>

04:03.670 --> 04:08.100
<b>I chased my entire life
into my memory as long as possible!</b>

04:10.650 --> 04:12.110
<b>King Arthur?</b>

04:12.110 --> 04:13.690
<b>That's correct!</b>

04:13.690 --> 04:18.360
<b>What you're seeing is a part of the Fourth
Holy Grail War that happened in Fuyuki...</b>

04:18.360 --> 04:20.530
<b>almost 15 years ago!</b>

04:21.240 --> 04:24.990
<b>Luckily, I was able to see the place
where three kings gathered!</b>

04:33.380 --> 04:34.290
<b>In order to...</b>

04:34.630 --> 04:36.710
<b>grant salvation to the people...</b>

04:37.050 --> 04:40.630
<b>a king sacrifices himself
to the path of a righteous ideal.</b>

04:41.470 --> 04:46.470
<b>I would wish upon the Holy Grail
to return to the sword of selection,</b>

04:46.470 --> 04:48.640
<b>and if there were to be someone
more fit to be a king than I...</b>

04:49.140 --> 04:51.770
<b>yield my history to them...</b>

04:51.770 --> 04:53.900
<b>so that Britain can gain a new start.</b>

04:54.190 --> 04:57.900
<b>Sacrificing all for righteousness
and discarding everything about yourself?</b>

04:57.900 --> 04:59.990
<b>That is not how a person should live.</b>

05:00.650 --> 05:02.320
<b>King of Conquerors...</b>

05:02.320 --> 05:03.810
<b>How can you declare
that a rule where you stop</b>

05:03.830 --> 05:05.280
<b>being human is lesser
than that of a human?</b>

05:05.580 --> 05:06.950
<b>King of Knights...</b>

05:06.950 --> 05:10.160
<b>That way of life will someday raise you
from a human...</b>

05:10.500 --> 05:12.920
<b>into the realm of the gods.</b>

05:13.210 --> 05:15.210
<b>What are you laughing
about, King of Heroes?</b>

05:15.210 --> 05:19.170
<b>If such a thing were possible for a human,
is there any reason for hesitation?</b>

05:19.170 --> 05:22.180
<b>Seeking a path of divine righteousness</b>

05:22.200 --> 05:26.010
<b>ultimately brings about
a culling of the people.</b>

05:30.640 --> 05:31.890
<b>Saber...</b>

05:32.230 --> 05:33.640
<b>Destroy...</b>

05:33.640 --> 05:34.650
<b>the Holy Grail.</b>

05:34.940 --> 05:37.650
<b>Stooooop!</b>

05:46.200 --> 05:47.660
<b>Is this...</b>

05:47.660 --> 05:49.950
<b>how a Holy Grail War can end?</b>

05:50.540 --> 05:51.830
<b>This is...</b>

05:52.370 --> 05:54.290
<b>something you shouldn't
worry about, Saber!</b>

05:54.290 --> 05:55.290
<b>It's an illusion, right?</b>

05:55.630 --> 05:57.130
<b>It's all made up!</b>

05:57.460 --> 06:00.460
<b>I don't know about that! We'll see!</b>

06:00.460 --> 06:02.760
<b>How was it, King Lionheart?</b>

06:03.050 --> 06:06.550
<b>What's your opinion after watching
the king you admired for so long...</b>

06:06.550 --> 06:11.310
<b>try to make her heroic tale
something that never happened?</b>

06:11.680 --> 06:14.730
<b>A pathetic story where
the legendary King Arthur</b>

06:14.760 --> 06:17.610
<b>couldn't grasp a single
thing in her hands!</b>

06:18.110 --> 06:21.360
<b>A hero always faces a choice!</b>

06:21.360 --> 06:26.070
<b>And always, the choice that protects
human history is chosen!</b>

06:26.450 --> 06:27.910
<b>Hey, corpse.</b>

06:27.910 --> 06:31.040
<b>You previously mentioned
you were going to deny humanity...</b>

06:31.040 --> 06:33.910
<b>that Dead Apostles existed
to contaminate human history.</b>

06:34.330 --> 06:39.000
<b>But you're not going to deny Assassin,
who is a part of human history?</b>

06:40.130 --> 06:41.880
<b>What are you getting at?</b>

06:43.130 --> 06:45.550
<b>Defeating high-level
Dead Apostles like you...</b>

06:45.550 --> 06:47.840
<b>requires a consecrated weapon,</b>

06:47.870 --> 06:51.310
<b>a Singularity wielder
or a high-ranking Mage.</b>

06:51.310 --> 06:52.720
<b>Jeez.</b>

06:52.720 --> 06:54.770
<b>I guess this has all
been guided, as well...</b>

06:54.770 --> 06:56.270
<b>Dorothea.</b>

06:56.890 --> 06:57.900
<b><i>Play Ball!</i></b>

07:04.070 --> 07:05.860
<b>Jester, what's wrong?</b>

07:07.240 --> 07:09.370
<b>What the hell did you...</b>

07:09.660 --> 07:10.490
<b>Flat...</b>

07:10.490 --> 07:12.870
<b>Yep! You said that was
a body that split off...</b>

07:12.870 --> 07:14.760
<b>so I followed the
current of Magical Energy</b>

07:14.780 --> 07:16.040
<b>and attacked the main body!</b>

07:16.370 --> 07:19.420
<b>Impossible! I'm not simply
a body that split off—</b>

07:19.710 --> 07:21.250
<b>I know, I get it!</b>

07:21.250 --> 07:24.710
<b>It took a long time to distinguish
the pattern! So painstaking!</b>

07:25.010 --> 07:26.880
<b>Painstaking, you say?</b>

07:27.220 --> 07:28.590
<b>Dammit.</b>

07:28.590 --> 07:30.300
<b>That mercenary, too!</b>

07:30.300 --> 07:33.180
<b>Is this what a Holy
Grail War is all about?</b>

07:33.510 --> 07:36.020
<b>But none of that matters!</b>

07:36.430 --> 07:38.480
<b>To think you'd be so surprised...</b>

07:38.480 --> 07:41.150
<b>Perhaps you were being
a bit too conceited?</b>

07:41.150 --> 07:42.610
<b>Don't feign ignorance!</b>

07:42.610 --> 07:45.490
<b>How do you know of that name?</b>

07:45.860 --> 07:48.450
<b>Looks like the information was correct.</b>

07:48.450 --> 07:50.490
<b>I shouldn't be doing this
given my position,</b>

07:50.490 --> 07:53.830
<b>but I believe there is a need
to officially give my gratitude.</b>

07:53.830 --> 07:54.950
<b><i>No need for gratitude.</i></b>

07:55.620 --> 07:57.390
<b><i>I only invested in the descendant</i></b>

07:57.410 --> 07:59.830
<b><i>of an old, important
friend of mine, not you.</i></b>

07:59.830 --> 08:03.750
<b><i>In return, I request
that you deal with the rubbish.</i></b>

08:03.750 --> 08:06.010
<b>That voice!</b>

08:06.420 --> 08:08.970
<b><i>Flat, whose voice was that just now?</i></b>

08:08.970 --> 08:13.550
<b>I called the one vampire
that I exchanged phone numbers with!</b>

08:13.930 --> 08:15.220
<b>Can it be...</b>

08:15.220 --> 08:17.520
<b><i>That was a good lecture, Lord.</i></b>

08:17.520 --> 08:19.440
<b><i>It seems I have quite a relationship...</i></b>

08:19.440 --> 08:22.060
<b><i>with the students of your classroom.</i></b>

08:23.060 --> 08:25.980
<b>The Twenty-Seven Dead Apostle Ancestors,
their pinnacle...</b>

08:25.980 --> 08:27.880
<b>If one of them were
going to listen in,</b>

08:27.900 --> 08:30.150
<b>I should have chosen
my words more wisely...</b>

08:30.610 --> 08:32.120
<b><i>Sir Van-Fem.</i></b>

08:32.120 --> 08:33.950
<b>I was quite intrigued listening in.</b>

08:34.660 --> 08:37.700
<b>So much so, I believe
it is of no loss to me in this bargain.</b>

08:37.950 --> 08:43.250
<b>Are you planning on getting
in my way, Lord Vandelstam?</b>

08:43.250 --> 08:47.380
<b><i>A Dead Apostle is one
that denies humanity, you say.</i></b>

08:47.380 --> 08:48.800
<b><i>Indeed, that is how it is.</i></b>

08:49.220 --> 08:51.340
<b>Thus the stain that you are.</b>

08:51.340 --> 08:53.720
<b>Claiming to deny the world of humans...</b>

08:53.720 --> 08:56.510
<b>yet in love with a hero, the culmination
of human history.</b>

08:56.850 --> 08:58.850
<b>It's what you call a "double standard."</b>

08:59.770 --> 09:01.680
<b><i>If you are going to
change how you exist</i></b>

09:01.700 --> 09:04.440
<b><i>as a Dead Apostle depending
on who you're dealing with,</i></b>

09:04.440 --> 09:07.440
<b><i>you have become an unnecessary bug
engraved into this world.</i></b>

09:07.860 --> 09:10.700
<b><i>Flat, please clean up that thing for me.</i></b>

09:14.950 --> 09:16.950
<b>Francesca Prelati!</b>

09:19.540 --> 09:21.000
<b>Saber...</b>

09:21.000 --> 09:23.580
<b>I give you my gratitude
from the bottom of my heart.</b>

09:24.000 --> 09:25.330
<b>- Huh?
- Huh?</b>

09:25.330 --> 09:27.840
<b>For giving me an indirect rendition</b>

09:27.860 --> 09:31.300
<b>of a new epic tale of
the great King of Knights!</b>

09:32.260 --> 09:35.800
<b>In my case, I know everything
about the legend of the Round Table.</b>

09:35.800 --> 09:39.440
<b>How the king is betrayed,
how she is irrational,</b>

09:39.470 --> 09:42.640
<b>and how she loses everything in the end.</b>

09:43.140 --> 09:44.360
<b>But my admiration stems</b>

09:44.390 --> 09:46.900
<b>from the entire package,
including all of that.</b>

09:46.900 --> 09:50.610
<b>Besides, the King of Knights
was not denied by the other two.</b>

09:51.070 --> 09:52.240
<b>Is that so?</b>

09:52.240 --> 09:54.490
<b>The King of Conquerors was simply angry.</b>

09:54.490 --> 09:56.700
<b>He did not deny the royal road
of the King of Knights.</b>

09:57.240 --> 10:00.750
<b>Depending on the times, the land,
and feelings of the people and subjects...</b>

10:00.750 --> 10:02.910
<b>what is just or not can easily vary.</b>

10:03.290 --> 10:06.290
<b>That is why that question
does not have a right answer,</b>

10:06.290 --> 10:11.300
<b>and those three knew that
more than anyone else. But...</b>

10:11.630 --> 10:12.970
<b>let's see.</b>

10:12.970 --> 10:14.380
<b>If I had to say something,</b>

10:14.380 --> 10:18.640
<b>there was one thing our King of Knights
lacked compared to the other kings.</b>

10:19.470 --> 10:21.850
<b>She simply had a softer
voice than the others!</b>

10:25.600 --> 10:28.110
<b>Oh, that's the direction
you're taking this?</b>

10:28.110 --> 10:32.280
<b>More like, you're not surprised
that King Arthur was a girl?</b>

10:32.940 --> 10:35.320
<b>So, you knew, didn't you?</b>

10:35.860 --> 10:38.030
<b>The legend of the true King Arthur...</b>

10:38.030 --> 10:40.490
<b>Altria Pendragon.</b>

10:40.490 --> 10:44.120
<b>You somehow found out
back when you were alive.</b>

10:44.120 --> 10:47.630
<b>Just as I thought.
That is what you were really after.</b>

10:48.170 --> 10:50.240
<b>You wanted to know just
how far I stepped myself</b>

10:50.260 --> 10:52.590
<b>into the history of the
King of Knights, didn't you?</b>

10:53.300 --> 10:55.300
<b>But it really was amazing!</b>

10:55.590 --> 11:00.300
<b>Alexander the Great, that golden one,
and our ancestral king!</b>

11:00.300 --> 11:03.100
<b>All rulers beyond my imagination!</b>

11:04.850 --> 11:06.140
<b>Ayaka...</b>

11:07.020 --> 11:09.110
<b>That determination you showed earlier...</b>

11:09.110 --> 11:10.730
<b>I decided to accept it after all!</b>

11:12.070 --> 11:15.990
<b>I would like to redo
my first encounter with you.</b>

11:21.740 --> 11:22.790
<b>I ask you.</b>

11:23.620 --> 11:24.790
<b>Are you...</b>

11:25.790 --> 11:27.540
<b>my Master?</b>

11:30.710 --> 11:31.670
<b>Dammit!</b>

11:32.090 --> 11:34.260
<b>What is that Saber—</b>

11:34.960 --> 11:35.970
<b>What is it this time?</b>

11:37.430 --> 11:38.430
<b>That is...</b>

11:39.640 --> 11:41.010
<b>I see.</b>

11:41.010 --> 11:43.640
<b>I have been forsaken?</b>

11:44.020 --> 11:46.100
<b>Now we match...</b>

11:46.430 --> 11:48.690
<b>my beloved Assassin!</b>

11:49.520 --> 11:50.270
<b>What are you...</b>

11:52.690 --> 11:53.900
<b>Mr. Hansa!</b>

11:54.190 --> 11:55.990
<b>That might be bad news!</b>

11:57.190 --> 12:00.990
<b>All right! I shall prove it to you!</b>

12:01.280 --> 12:03.860
<b>I will grasp the Holy
Grail with my own hands,</b>

12:03.890 --> 12:06.870
<b>and with its power, I will
destroy all of humanity!</b>

12:06.870 --> 12:11.960
<b>And when humanity is
reduced to just her...</b>

12:13.170 --> 12:16.590
<b>I will affirm it once more!</b>

12:16.880 --> 12:20.180
<b>When the time comes, I will have you
hold a banquet to celebrate...</b>

12:20.180 --> 12:22.850
<b>Lord Vandelstam!</b>

12:22.850 --> 12:25.640
<b>Did I make the spell a
bit too rough on him?</b>

12:25.640 --> 12:28.850
<b>Rest assured. He's been like this
from the beginning.</b>

12:30.390 --> 12:32.310
<b>Are you targeting Tsubaki Kuruoka?</b>

12:42.740 --> 12:44.620
<b><i>Flat, what's going on?</i></b>

12:47.120 --> 12:48.450
<b>Everyone, retreat!</b>

12:53.960 --> 12:55.000
<b>Sorry.</b>

12:55.000 --> 12:56.550
<b>I was asleep for a bit.</b>

12:57.090 --> 12:59.760
<b>You sure are looking good.</b>

12:59.760 --> 13:01.760
<b>Did you wake
from a good dream or something?</b>

13:02.260 --> 13:04.970
<b>Yeah, I'm sure the dream's coming true.</b>

13:05.470 --> 13:06.970
<b>Right, Master?</b>

13:07.350 --> 13:09.140
<b>Just call me "Ayaka."</b>

13:09.640 --> 13:10.480
<b>Ayaka.</b>

13:10.850 --> 13:14.400
<b>I want to use the Holy Grail
for something extremely selfish.</b>

13:14.900 --> 13:16.360
<b>With the power of the Holy Grail...</b>

13:16.940 --> 13:19.650
<b>I want song to echo
throughout a particular location.</b>

13:22.820 --> 13:23.820
<b>Sorry...</b>

13:23.820 --> 13:26.160
<b>can I borrow a sword?</b>

13:29.910 --> 13:31.000
<b>Thank you.</b>

13:31.750 --> 13:33.980
<b>The enemy is likely the Grim Reaper,</b>

13:34.000 --> 13:36.670
<b>and its energy is
likely this world itself.</b>

13:37.090 --> 13:38.670
<b>A most worthy opponent!</b>

13:53.350 --> 13:54.440
<b>Wow!</b>

13:54.440 --> 13:56.900
<b>This is turning into one huge deal!</b>

13:57.190 --> 14:01.400
<b>Quiet down. You will make
the concealment spell meaningless.</b>

14:01.400 --> 14:03.070
<b>Hansa, it was a good thing...</b>

14:03.360 --> 14:06.320
<b>we searched inside the room beforehand!</b>

14:06.320 --> 14:08.700
<b>A parachute similar to a Mystic Code...</b>

14:08.700 --> 14:11.410
<b>I don't know who left them,
but they're quite generous.</b>

14:13.000 --> 14:16.330
<b>King Arthur truly was someone
just like in the legends!</b>

14:16.670 --> 14:18.130
<b>I give my praise!</b>

14:18.590 --> 14:20.710
<b>Even if the King of Conquerors
shows his anger...</b>

14:21.880 --> 14:24.220
<b>even if the King of Heroes scoffs!</b>

14:25.430 --> 14:28.350
<b>I affirm her chivalry...</b>

14:28.350 --> 14:31.970
<b>the building of her ideals,
even if it means nullifying...</b>

14:31.970 --> 14:34.230
<b>all which her subjects accomplished!</b>

14:34.560 --> 14:36.480
<b>Such tyranny...</b>

14:36.480 --> 14:38.110
<b>is further proof of a king!</b>

14:39.480 --> 14:42.820
<b>However, the great king did not notice.</b>

14:43.360 --> 14:45.320
<b>The kingdom created by the Round Table</b>

14:45.340 --> 14:47.660
<b>and seemingly destroyed
by the Round Table...</b>

14:47.660 --> 14:50.160
<b>needs no new start!</b>

14:53.290 --> 14:54.910
<b>King Arthur...</b>

14:55.250 --> 14:56.920
<b>has indeed...</b>

14:56.920 --> 14:59.290
<b>guided us to Avalon!</b>

14:59.630 --> 15:02.800
<b>Oh boy, he's sure running
his mouth as he pleases.</b>

15:03.460 --> 15:05.760
<b>Altry is having a hard time here with more</b>

15:05.780 --> 15:08.470
<b>expectations piled on
top of her after her death.</b>

15:08.470 --> 15:11.760
<b>I thought he'd show
a much uglier side of himself...</b>

15:12.060 --> 15:14.100
<b>but he's quite the staunch one.</b>

15:14.520 --> 15:16.850
<b>But maybe it's good!</b>

15:16.850 --> 15:19.520
<b>I like that king!</b>

15:19.520 --> 15:20.480
<b>And...</b>

15:20.820 --> 15:23.990
<b>that girl looks like an
interesting one, too!</b>

15:24.570 --> 15:28.450
<b>The path of kingship you walked
was not mistaken.</b>

15:29.120 --> 15:31.830
<b>The path you left behind,
the pride left by the Round Table...</b>

15:31.830 --> 15:34.910
<b>We who followed had something to admire!</b>

15:35.580 --> 15:39.130
<b>And we will continue to admire it!</b>

15:39.670 --> 15:41.710
<b>I have lost the qualification
to do so, but...</b>

15:41.710 --> 15:43.710
<b>someday, one will come
and reach where you are!</b>

15:43.710 --> 15:44.800
<b>I will...</b>

15:44.800 --> 15:45.550
<b>No...</b>

15:46.090 --> 15:47.090
<b>I shall...</b>

15:47.090 --> 15:49.090
<b>use the power
of the Holy Grail...</b>

15:50.180 --> 15:52.930
<b>to sing a song of human victory...</b>

15:53.310 --> 15:55.470
<b>to the very ends of...</b>

15:55.470 --> 15:57.770
<b>ever-distant Avalon!</b>

15:58.270 --> 16:01.230
<b>Tsubaki, go fetch your father and mother.</b>

16:01.560 --> 16:02.690
<b>O-Okay!</b>

16:05.780 --> 16:07.530
<b>Hold it. Hold up.</b>

16:07.530 --> 16:12.070
<b>It's a pain in the ass
to don a new guise of a child.</b>

16:17.460 --> 16:18.540
<b>What's wrong?</b>

16:21.670 --> 16:22.920
<b>Monsters...</b>

16:23.290 --> 16:24.300
<b>Monsters!</b>

16:26.510 --> 16:27.630
<b>Mr. Black...</b>

16:27.630 --> 16:28.470
<b>Tsubaki...</b>

16:28.970 --> 16:30.340
<b>What's the matter?</b>

16:30.680 --> 16:32.600
<b>Father!</b>

16:32.600 --> 16:33.430
<b>Ghosts...</b>

16:33.430 --> 16:35.010
<b>So many ghosts...</b>

16:35.470 --> 16:37.390
<b>It's all right, Tsubaki.</b>

16:37.390 --> 16:41.310
<b>Those big skeletons are all on your side.</b>

16:41.690 --> 16:43.190
<b>That's right, Tsubaki.</b>

16:43.190 --> 16:45.520
<b>They are the same as Mr. Black.</b>

16:46.070 --> 16:46.980
<b>Huh?</b>

16:49.610 --> 16:50.860
<b>Is the girl all right?</b>

16:51.240 --> 16:52.450
<b>Miss!</b>

16:52.450 --> 16:53.200
<b>Assassin!</b>

16:53.570 --> 16:55.450
<b>He's in the basement!</b>

16:59.080 --> 17:00.500
<b>Miss!</b>

17:00.500 --> 17:01.960
<b>It's dangerous, Tsubaki.</b>

17:02.330 --> 17:04.710
<b>Why? Why did Miss—</b>

17:04.710 --> 17:09.170
<b>Because that young lady
is trying to kill you.</b>

17:09.550 --> 17:12.010
<b>She said it would be a problem...</b>

17:12.010 --> 17:13.720
<b>if you stayed alive.</b>

17:14.010 --> 17:15.300
<b>Stop it!</b>

17:15.300 --> 17:17.430
<b>Me? Why?</b>

17:17.770 --> 17:20.390
<b>You are the king of this world.</b>

17:20.940 --> 17:25.770
<b>The people who are jealous of you
are trying to bully you.</b>

17:25.770 --> 17:29.440
<b>Mr. Black will protect
you from all of them.</b>

17:29.440 --> 17:30.900
<b>Forever.</b>

17:30.900 --> 17:32.070
<b>But...</b>

17:32.070 --> 17:33.860
<b>then all the people in town...</b>

17:34.200 --> 17:37.370
<b>It doesn't matter how many townsfolk die.</b>

17:37.700 --> 17:39.450
<b>They're simply expendable.</b>

17:39.750 --> 17:42.420
<b>Right. And I've always
been telling you, haven't I?</b>

17:42.960 --> 17:47.040
<b>The only thing you need
to think about is Magecraft.</b>

17:47.750 --> 17:48.840
<b>I see.</b>

17:49.710 --> 17:51.130
<b>I...</b>

17:51.130 --> 17:53.550
<b>failed again, didn't I?</b>

17:54.300 --> 17:55.010
<b>What are...</b>

17:56.890 --> 17:58.510
<b>I'm all right.</b>

17:59.930 --> 18:01.060
<b>I'll do my best.</b>

18:02.560 --> 18:04.770
<b>I'll do my best, so...</b>

18:06.110 --> 18:08.650
<b>please, Mr. Black.</b>

18:09.230 --> 18:10.070
<b>Huh?</b>

18:10.400 --> 18:11.280
<b>Stop it!</b>

18:11.570 --> 18:12.490
<b>Wait!</b>

18:12.990 --> 18:14.450
<b>You are...</b>

18:14.450 --> 18:15.950
<b>Everything...</b>

18:16.700 --> 18:19.490
<b>Please make everything the way it was!</b>

18:20.290 --> 18:21.580
<b>Stop it!</b>

18:22.460 --> 18:23.710
<b>Please...</b>

18:24.370 --> 18:26.170
<b>make me...</b>

18:26.500 --> 18:29.590
<b>all alone forever and ever!</b>

18:48.360 --> 18:50.820
<b>What the hell have you guys done?</b>

18:51.440 --> 18:52.990
<b>What kind of life...</b>

18:52.990 --> 18:55.400
<b>what has she been forced to do...</b>

18:55.400 --> 18:57.990
<b>for a young child to
voluntarily choose this?</b>

18:58.280 --> 19:01.490
<b>What have you been doing
to your own daughter?</b>

19:02.290 --> 19:03.960
<b>Oh man...</b>

19:03.960 --> 19:05.500
<b>what a wet blanket.</b>

19:05.500 --> 19:08.790
<b>I didn't think she'd break that badly.</b>

19:10.130 --> 19:12.460
<b>See you, Miss.</b>

19:13.550 --> 19:14.970
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

19:16.800 --> 19:19.890
<b>I didn't think Tsubaki
would gain Command Spells.</b>

19:20.260 --> 19:24.980
<b>But our methodology was
not wrong after all.</b>

19:25.310 --> 19:26.730
<b>Sigma, was it?</b>

19:27.270 --> 19:29.360
<b>Can you contact Faldeus?</b>

19:29.360 --> 19:32.150
<b>Dear, we need to head
to the hospital first.</b>

19:32.150 --> 19:32.900
<b>Right.</b>

19:33.570 --> 19:36.860
<b>We can procure equipment
to cut the right hand off over there.</b>

19:36.860 --> 19:38.700
<b>Please let Faldeus know.</b>

19:38.990 --> 19:41.500
<b>We will enter the Holy
Grail War as soon as</b>

19:41.520 --> 19:44.330
<b>we transplant the Command
Spells from Tsubaki.</b>

19:44.330 --> 19:45.660
<b>Transplant?</b>

19:45.910 --> 19:46.870
<b><i>You, dear...</i></b>

19:47.420 --> 19:51.170
<b>That little Tsubaki used up
two strokes of Command Spells.</b>

19:51.170 --> 19:56.090
<b>But with the power of that Heroic Spirit,
we can gain quite an advantage.</b>

19:56.380 --> 19:58.590
<b><i>You, dear. Listen closely.</i></b>

19:59.220 --> 20:01.890
<b>Are you going to sever Tsubaki's hand?</b>

20:02.260 --> 20:05.890
<b>Yeah. It's a blessing that
she can't do any ridiculous screaming.</b>

20:05.890 --> 20:07.280
<b>In the worse case scenario,</b>

20:07.300 --> 20:10.190
<b>we have to preserve
at least her reproductive functions.</b>

20:10.190 --> 20:17.150
<b><i>What you need to eradicate are the ones
who are trying to plunder from us.</i></b>

20:17.530 --> 20:19.860
<b>I see. It's you guys.</b>

20:21.120 --> 20:22.580
<b>Why do you have that?</b>

20:22.870 --> 20:24.950
<b>I'd like you to return it.</b>

20:25.450 --> 20:26.290
<b>I have been...</b>

20:26.870 --> 20:30.580
<b>participating in this Holy Grail War
as one of the Masters.</b>

20:30.580 --> 20:32.250
<b>My boss Francesca...</b>

20:32.630 --> 20:36.590
<b>has authorized me
to wage war at my own discretion.</b>

20:37.010 --> 20:39.720
<b>Hey, don't get any
strange ideas, got that?</b>

20:41.220 --> 20:42.430
<b>From me...</b>

20:42.430 --> 20:44.010
<b>as a spellcaster...</b>

20:44.010 --> 20:45.890
<b>not a Mage...</b>

20:45.890 --> 20:48.600
<b>This is a declaration of war against you.</b>

20:52.020 --> 20:53.020
<b>We're back?</b>

20:55.320 --> 20:56.980
<b>So, they have returned.</b>

20:57.280 --> 21:00.450
<b>I've had stomach pain for a while now,
but it will be over in a few more days.</b>

21:01.070 --> 21:04.280
<b>I must adjust things now in earnest.</b>

21:04.280 --> 21:05.410
<b>What first?</b>

21:05.740 --> 21:07.200
<b>First off...</b>

21:07.750 --> 21:10.370
<b>I guess I'll get a prescription
for stomach medication.</b>

21:11.120 --> 21:13.130
<b>Oh, there you are!</b>

21:13.130 --> 21:14.210
<b>Hey!</b>

21:14.790 --> 21:16.420
<b>Ayaka!</b>

21:16.420 --> 21:18.090
<b>Huh? Who?</b>

21:18.090 --> 21:19.720
<b>Why do you know my name?</b>

21:20.050 --> 21:22.510
<b>Oh, you really are someone else!</b>

21:22.840 --> 21:25.640
<b>But your name is also Ayaka?</b>

21:26.180 --> 21:27.560
<b>I'm Flat!</b>

21:27.560 --> 21:28.810
<b>Nice to meet you!</b>

21:29.180 --> 21:30.980
<b>You know about me?</b>

21:31.390 --> 21:35.190
<b>I'm friends with someone
who has the same face and name you do.</b>

21:35.650 --> 21:39.490
<b>But your Magical Energy flow...
so it really is...</b>

21:39.490 --> 21:42.110
<b>Tell me if you know something about me!</b>

21:42.570 --> 21:43.780
<b>What am I...</b>

21:43.780 --> 21:46.410
<b>Who is Ayaka Sajyou?</b>

21:46.740 --> 21:51.620
<b>Yep, you really don't have
a good grasp of what you are.</b>

21:52.210 --> 21:53.420
<b>All right.</b>

21:53.420 --> 21:55.380
<b>Listen up. Your body is—</b>

22:00.210 --> 22:01.220
<b>Huh?</b>

22:03.880 --> 22:04.890
<b>Master?</b>

22:06.140 --> 22:07.100
<b>Wha...</b>

22:07.640 --> 22:09.310
<b>It's so bright.</b>

22:10.100 --> 22:11.730
<b>I can't see well.</b>

22:12.940 --> 22:14.810
<b>I'm sorry, Mr. Jack.</b>

22:15.150 --> 22:16.980
<b>I screwed up.</b>

22:18.480 --> 22:19.400
<b>Flat!</b>

22:19.900 --> 22:21.900
<b>I'm sorry, Professor.</b>

22:22.650 --> 22:23.860
<b>Everyone...</b>

22:23.860 --> 22:25.030
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

22:29.240 --> 22:33.120
<b>Nooooo!</b>

22:33.120 --> 22:34.870
<b><i>Target's head
has been confirmed demolished.</i></b>

22:35.290 --> 22:36.460
<b><i>Pursuit complete.</i></b>

22:36.460 --> 22:38.710
<b>So, this is your stomach medicine?</b>

22:38.710 --> 22:39.880
<b>Yes.</b>

22:39.880 --> 22:42.130
<b>Getting rid of the cause of your stress</b>

22:42.150 --> 22:44.630
<b>one by one is the
best way to deal with it.</b>

22:46.140 --> 22:47.050
<b>This is...</b>

22:47.800 --> 22:50.810
<b>It seems Flat Escardos has met his end.</b>

22:51.390 --> 22:53.060
<b>I shall give a blessing...</b>

22:53.060 --> 22:54.940
<b>to the great deed...</b>

22:55.270 --> 22:57.730
<b>my old neighbor has accomplished.</b>

22:58.480 --> 22:59.610
<b>What in the world...</b>

23:00.650 --> 23:02.570
<b>is going on?</b>

23:04.780 --> 23:07.740
<b>You look as though you've come
to a reconciliation within yourself.</b>

23:08.120 --> 23:10.030
<b>Francesca had told me.</b>

23:10.370 --> 23:11.660
<b>That my mother...</b>

23:11.660 --> 23:15.920
<b>participated and died in a Holy Grail War
as an assistant to a mercenary.</b>

23:16.290 --> 23:17.380
<b>That makes you sad?</b>

23:17.380 --> 23:19.960
<b>No. I finally understand now.</b>

23:20.290 --> 23:21.840
<b>I was jealous.</b>

23:22.550 --> 23:26.050
<b>Because I'm sure Mother
had discovered her reason to live.</b>

23:26.470 --> 23:29.100
<b>So, what are you going to do from here?</b>

23:29.100 --> 23:31.720
<b>I was told I can act freely...</b>

23:31.720 --> 23:33.020
<b>so that's what I'll do.</b>

23:35.480 --> 23:37.940
<b>I will take this Holy Grail War...</b>

23:37.940 --> 23:39.980
<b>EPISODE 13</b>

23:38.560 --> 23:39.980
<b>and destroy it!</b>
